<title>USA: MBIA qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--San Juan USD, Calif., $7.135 million Certificates of Participation.</p>
<p>--Florida, $13.26 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Macomb County Building Authority, Mich., $1.7 million building authority bonds</p>
<p>--Canton CSD, N.Y., $2.15 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Clyde-Savannah CSD, N.Y., $12.795 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
